rustd-gotool includes a Go lexer, FileSet, parser, and ast.Fprint
printer whose control flow and error conditions are derived from the
Go standard library packages go/token, go/scanner, go/parser, and
go/ast (BSD-3-Clause, The Go Authors).

Unicode identifier tables (Letter / Digit / Upper range tables) are
generated from Go 1.24.13 unicode data.

This is not a line-for-line translation of the Go sources.

